{
  "id": "native_trade",
  "name": "Native Settlement Trade",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -150,
      "params": {
        "text": "Trading at a native settlement (spec/systems/natives.md). The price the natives pay is a PERCENT of the European value: native_trade_price = min( max(5*difficulty + 50, 2*tax%), 90 ) -- it rises with difficulty and with your own tax rate, capped at 90% (BYTE_VERIFIED sim/natives.cpp). The offer for 100 units of a good is price.<good> * 100 * pct/100. Accepting pays gold and eases tension; every term is a live binding or an inline constant in a Formula -- no magic-number nodes. (Tribute demands use the sibling formula tribute_gold = clamp(demand, 10, min(3*wealth+10, 100)).)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trig",
      "type": "OnTestFire",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 70,
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "pct",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 210,
      "params": { "expr": "min(max(5*game.difficulty + 50, 2*power0.tax), 90)" }
    },
    {
      "id": "offer",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 210,
      "params": { "expr": "price.12 * 100 * a / 100" }
    },
    {
      "id": "offer2",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 290,
      "params": { "expr": "a * 110 / 100" }
    },
    {
      "id": "qty",
      "type": "PickText",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 320,
      "params": { "options": "100 units of" }
    },
    {
      "id": "gname",
      "type": "GetState",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 390,
      "params": { "path": "@CARGO[12].name" }
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg",
      "type": "ShowPopup",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 70,
      "params": {
        "textKey": "@TRADE0",
        "speaker": "Native Chief",
        "choices": "Accept,Haggle,Decline"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "accept",
      "type": "GrantGold",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 40,
      "params": { "power": "0" }
    },
    {
      "id": "relief",
      "type": "ChangeNativeTension",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "params": { "amount": -4 }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": { "node": "trig", "pin": "out" }, "to": { "node": "dlg", "pin": "in" } },
    { "from": { "node": "pct", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "offer", "pin": "a" } },
    { "from": { "node": "offer", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "dlg", "pin": "num0" } },
    { "from": { "node": "offer", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "offer2", "pin": "a" } },
    { "from": { "node": "offer2", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "dlg", "pin": "num1" } },
    { "from": { "node": "qty", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "dlg", "pin": "str0" } },
    { "from": { "node": "gname", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "dlg", "pin": "str1" } },
    { "from": { "node": "offer", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "accept", "pin": "amount" } },
    { "from": { "node": "dlg", "pin": "Accept" }, "to": { "node": "accept", "pin": "in" } },
    { "from": { "node": "accept", "pin": "out" }, "to": { "node": "relief", "pin": "in" } }
  ]
}
